title: BuildingBlocks
headline: BuildingBlocks
subheadline: The foundational data infrastructure that powers every Tolemi solution.
features:
  - title: One-click property data
    body: >-
      A complete, up-to-date profile for every property in your municipality
      with information pulled automatically from any system or department.
    images: []
  - title: Search and filter properties
    body: >-
      Easy-to-use filters and search tools to quickly identify properties that
      meet specific criteria relevant to your work.
    images: []
  - title: Research and link owners
    body: >-
      Comprehensive data on every owner in your municipality in a single screen,
      and smart linking that identifies potentially related owners through shell
      LLC's.
    images: []
  - title: Build and share reports
    body: >-
      Customizable reports and data visualization tools, shareable through
      dashboards that automatically refresh when the data changes.
