  - title: Set alerts
    body: >-
      Get an email delivered to your inbox when properties meet custom-defined
      triggers so you can stay on top of changing conditions and stay ahead of
      the game.
    images: []
---
BuildingBlocks is a map-based application that connects and updates data held in different systems and formats across departments & agencies. Your staff can find the answers they need in seconds, run advanced spatial analysis, and automate reports in a single interface.
